American College of Radiology. ACR Appropriateness Criteria: Chronic Shoulder Pain. Official narrative reports revision 2022. English.

[Authorized source](https://acsearch.acr.org/docs/3101482/narrative/).

Compare the clinical scenarios and appropriateness tables rather than treating one row as a rule for every shoulder. Use the evidence discussion and references to understand which question each modality addresses. These are professional imaging criteria, not a requirement that every reader or patient obtain imaging.

**Access and reuse:** Freely readable on the author, publisher, or institution website. Copyright remains with the stated rights holder; no local copy or permission to adapt is supplied.

